          "describe": "Neural Drive unlocks the β partition, initial β computing power: <color=#F74848>4</color>\n\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>1</color>:\n· Destroying the target can trigger [Re-Act], allowing action with full movement distance.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>4</color>:\n· When breaking a part, restore <color=#F74848>1</color> AP after combat, effective up to <color=#F74848>1</color> time per turn.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>7</color>:\n· AP Cap <color=#F74848>+1</color>.\n",
