          "ActivateUnitConsumption": "2:1:10801005:5/2:1:10801004:8/",
          "describe": "Neural Drive unlocks the γ partition, initial γ computing power: <color=#F74848>4</color>\n\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>1</color>:\n· During an Active Attack with a Melee Weapon, there is a <color=#F74848>20%</color> chance to trigger [Flurry Strike] following the enemy's attack, dealing <color=#F74848>0.5x</color> DMG.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>4</color>:\n· AP Cap <color=#F74848>+1</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>7</color>:\n· [Re-ATK] or [Re-Act]'s effective times per turn <color=#F74848>+1</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>10</color>:\n· Before an Active Attack, the probability of triggering [Flurry Strike] increases by <color=#F74848>6%</color> for each <color=#F74848>1</color> tile moved, up to <color=#F74848>30%</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>13</color>:\n· [Flurry Strike] damage multiplier is increased to <color=#F74848>0.75</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>16</color>:\n· When triggering [Flurry Strike], prioritize hitting the part with the lowest HP.\n",
