          "describe": "Neural Drive unlocks the γ partition\n\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>1</color>:\n· Maximum [Edge Momentum] stacks gain per action increases to <color=#F74848>8</color>. Talent [Re-ATK] effect is upgraded to [Re-Act].\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>4</color>:\n· AP Cap <color=#F74848>+1</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>7</color>:\n· When destroying a target, additionally restores <color=#F74848>1</color> AP after combat. Can trigger up to <color=#F74848>2</color> times per turn.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>10</color>:\n· When actively attacking, if the target's body is at full HP, ignores <color=#F74848>25%</color> target's Armor and Critical Hit chance increases by <color=#F74848>10%</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>13</color>:\n· Chainsaw Final DMG Dealt increases by <color=#F74848>10%</color>. When possessing <color=#F74848>3</color> or more stacks of [Razor Feather], Chainsaw Final DMG Dealt additionally increases by <color=#F74848>15%</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>16</color>:\n· When possessing <color=#F74848>5</color> or more stacks of [Edge Momentum], if AP is insufficient to cast any skill, can consume <color=#F74848>5</color> stacks of [Edge Momentum] to pay for <color=#F74848>1</color> AP cost. This effect can trigger <color=#F74848>2</color> times per turn.\n",
